    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 27(1) of the Universities Act, No. 16 of 1978, I, Lakshman Kiriella,Minister of Higher Education and Highways, do by this Order, amend the Order made under Section 21 of the aforesaidAct, on the recommendation of the University Grants Commission, and published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 420/25of September 26, 1986 in relation to the Eastern University, Sri Lanka, (as last amended by Order published in GazetteExtraordinary No. 1995/27 of December 1, 2016 as follows :-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      71.25,
      465.61,
      539.86,
      488.68
    ],
